Attribution should cite the data descriptor accompanying this package; see
inst/CITATION or call citation("fishmetaweb") once the package is installed.

The underlying sources carry their own terms. Trait data derive from FishBase,
the phylogeny from the Fish Tree of Life, documented interactions from the
Global Biotic Interactions database, and occurrence records from OBIS and GBIF.
